OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA mix of
OL,6,Fclear spells and cloudier periods
OL,7,Fovernight. Most places staying dry,
OL,8,Falthough isolated heavy showers remain
OL,9,Fpossible. Mist or fog patches forming
OL,10,Fin places as the wind remains light.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FDry with warm sunny spells
OL,13,Ffor most, although isolated showers
OL,14,Fmay develop across the Pennines. The
OL,15,Fwind picking up in the afternoon,
OL,16,Fbefore easing by the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
