OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FDry
OL,6,Fstart Friday, wet and windy for some
OL,7,Flater. Cloudy and potentially wet in
OL,8,Fplaces Saturday. Possible fog patches
OL,9,FSunday morning, dry with variable
OL,10,Fcloud later. Slightly above average
OL,11,Ftemperatures.
